### EVENT MUSICIAN ENDPOINTS ###
### Note: Only users with roles 'user' or 'admin' can access these endpoints
### Users can only manage musicians for their own events, admins can manage all

### Get musicians assigned to an event
GET {{api}}/events/1/musicians
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Assign a musician to an event
POST {{api}}/events/1/musicians
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": 1,
  "musician_id": 3,
  "role": "Lead Guitarist",
  "salary": 400.00,
  "payment_status": "PENDING"
}

###

### Update a musician's assignment (role/salary)
PATCH {{api}}/events/1/musicians/2
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Solo Guitarist",
  "salary": 1600.00,
  "payment_status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

### Remove a musician from an event
DELETE {{api}}/events/1/musicians/2
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Get musicians summary for an event
GET {{api}}/events/1/musicians/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Try to assign musician who is already assigned (should fail with 409 Conflict)
