### MUSICIAN AVAILABILITY ENDPOINTS ###
### Note: Only users with roles 'musician', 'auxiliar_musician', or 'admin' can access these endpoints
### Musicians and auxiliar_musicians can only manage their own availability, admins can manage all

### Get availability for a specific musician (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only view their own, admin can view any)
GET {{api}}/musician-availability/6
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Check if a musician is available on a specific date
GET {{api}}/musician-availability/check/6/2026-04-15
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Create a new availability entry (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only create for themselves, admin can create for any)
POST {{api}}/musician-availability
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "musician_id": 6,
  "unavailable_date": "2026-04-20",
  "reason": "Holiday trip"
}

### Create bulk availability entries (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only create for themselves, admin can create for any)
POST {{api}}/musician-availability/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "musician_id": 6,
    "unavailable_date": "2026-04-22",
    "reason": "Family vacation"
  },
  {
    "musician_id": 6,
    "unavailable_date": "2026-04-21",
    "reason": "Family vacation"
  }
]

### Update an existing availability entry (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only update their own, admin can update any)
PATCH {{api}}/musician-availability/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

