### Delete an availability entry (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only delete their own, admin can delete any)
DELETE {{api}}/musician-availability/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Delete availability by musician and date (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only delete their own, admin can delete any)
